{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_title", "source_sha256": "662a3f4c97696f0cfd3d4823570869e8eba82eaf99eeac14b82d2711ba389b2c", "ja": "歌声をどこまでも", "zh": "歌声响彻天际", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "76f81de2ffc8f99aa361767e81be9381575c70f386c2367f51196da22cac3047", "ja": "長野での仕事を終え、休息兼観光として、\nパラボラアンテナを見に行った可奈、朋花、\n麗花。大きなアンテナを見て、いつか宇宙\nまで歌声を届けようと笑い合うのだった。", "zh": "结束了在长野的工作后，可奈、朋花和丽花把参观抛物面天线当作休息兼观光。看到巨大的天线，她们笑着约定，总有一天要把歌声传到宇宙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "56d1e89063410195476c680a32110546fc63f74ccc6e7b390a909d95b39e1fa6", "ja": "（長野での仕事を終え、休息がてら観光へ。\nうーん、このパラボラアンテナは壮観だな……）", "zh": "（结束了在长野的工作，顺便休息观光。\n嗯……这座抛物面天线真是壮观啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "4f18ff9eb64064446d9b059dc7aadc7c0125f7e7b14a6beda6ff8585ef71857d", "ja": "すごーい、大きなアンテナがいっぱいある～！\n奥には、すーっごく大きなアンテナまで！", "zh": "好厉害，到处都是好大的天线～！\n里面居然还有超级大的天线！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "1a60b4b3bd2a34f5497ca8b75f0eb717bfa73859393e90f732f75f75c6f95a51", "ja": "そっかぁ、これで宇宙と……。\n……宇宙と、何をしてるんだろう？", "zh": "这样啊，用这个和宇宙……。\n……和宇宙在做什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "83d8503ed14ffc4bb52c84cad6fe13905df54f6a9112a7b8d261c2e63f5e7425", "ja": "案内板によると、太陽やブラックホールなど、\n様々なものを観測しているそうですよ～。", "zh": "根据指示牌所说，那里似乎在观测太阳、黑洞等各种各样的东西哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "e8173040f991cbed3e62667c055f01eab7aa3a4a63198352883ce7a509b1587e", "ja": "弱い電波も、大きなパラボラで拾えるそうです～。\n宇宙の微かな声も聞き逃さないんですね～。", "zh": "微弱的电波，据说也能用巨大的抛物面天线接收到哦～。\n宇宙微弱的声音也不会漏听呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "221eabe42db39f1010b9d0ed8e5a4d643493d452f72a1cc47e0e4310c616cb16", "ja": "宇宙の声か……。もしかしたら、\nもう宇宙人のひとりやふたり、観測できているのかな。", "zh": "宇宙的声音吗……说不定\n其实已经观测到一两个外星人了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "2b488b7760a3f9ab3a3e2d00847fbb1cc7c2e164cf0259e96a373fbbbbd10d98", "ja": "そういうことなら……やっほー！　宇宙人さん、\n聞こえてますか～！？　北上麗花でーす！！", "zh": "既然这样……嗨——！外星人，你听得到吗～！？我是北上丽花——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2c3e3a2273dc850329e1f8269a02903d84520f8c02b97af1d500ea32d8172876", "ja": "さすがの声量だな、麗花……。とはいえ、\n宇宙までは到達しないと思うけど……。", "zh": "不愧是你的音量啊，丽花……不过，我觉得应该传不到宇宙那么远……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "2ac020c0f8fbab021418e11a8ac9d90fcd11730ebebc6fa9e8537ad6b7740282", "ja": "そうですか？　でもでも、いつか宇宙人さんに\n拾ってもらえるかもしれませんよ？", "zh": "是这样吗？可是可是，说不定哪天会被外星人听到哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "d1e43e1e6e74b650a47ceed7ba4bab43d430022dbdb8657b30b6f1f5af5ef1ec", "ja": "だって、地球ではこ～んな大きなアンテナで、\n一生懸命宇宙の声を拾おうとしてるんですから！", "zh": "因为，在地球上，人们正用这么——大的天线，拼命想要接收宇宙的声音呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "7f21b97592320595c03100e9653394fcb64225045ddd60286245a7f343534912", "ja": "それなら、宇宙で他の誰かが\n同じことをしてても、おかしくないかな？って♪", "zh": "那样的话，宇宙里的其他人也在做同样的事，好像也不奇怪吧？♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "717cd4ba6f1b3d86d39b18ae753d474131f4d174b572d8a5e4a59202cd28c932", "ja": "そうですね～。いつか宇宙にいる誰かに届いて、\n子豚ちゃん志願のメッセージが来るかもしれません～。", "zh": "是啊～。说不定有一天会传达到宇宙中的某个人那里，收到一条志愿成为小猪仔的消息呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "bce1c3dcdfdbcaadbd74dba73947d14281341d876fc8fabb1bc47bd576474455", "ja": "はい！　いつか宇宙人さんに\n聞いてもらうために、私も歌っておきますね！", "zh": "好的！为了有一天能让宇宙人听到，我也先唱给他们听吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "ad728f367af00068c7730a00a527701015de729523732526da4b59cb31509966", "ja": "今はここで歌ってるよ～、可奈～♪\nいつかはライブで渡るよ～、天の川～♪", "zh": "现在就在这里唱歌哦～可奈～♪\n总有一天要在演唱会上跨越银河哦～天之川～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_area01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_area01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e2db0027994bc057880256bd62d1b90d21b36d5cde752f06030da5122abe4f60", "ja": "（なるほど、いつか宇宙に届くまで、か……。\n銀河でのライブ……夢じゃないかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（原来如此，要一直唱到有一天传达到宇宙吗……。在银河里举办演唱会……说不定并不是梦想！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
